{% comment %}
REVIEW ONLY. No live notification has been edited.
Before the existing gift-card property guard in each ordinary purchased-line branch.
Install ONLY if that branch does not already render ordinary public line properties.
For the component branch, change the assignment below from line to component.
The unless guard preserves the original gift-card renderer without duplication.
Keep private underscore-prefixed data hidden; never read current product metafields.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign tlc_notification_line = line %}
{% unless tlc_notification_line.gift_card and tlc_notification_line.properties["__shopify_send_gift_card_to_recipient"] %}
{% for property in tlc_notification_line.properties %}
  {% assign first_character = property.first | slice: 0 %}
  {% if property.last != blank and first_character != '_' %}
    <p><strong>{{ property.first | escape_once }}:</strong> {{ property.last | escape_once }}</p>
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endunless %}
